Error [E0412]: write `priv`, not `private`
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_private_teaching.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | private fn secret() => Int :: 0
    | ^^^^^^^
 Why: inside a `#PubFile` file, `priv` marks an item that stays private to this file
 Fix: write `priv fn …` instead of `private fn …`

Error [E0113]: `run` promises to return Unit ? Err, but this `return` is empty
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_private_teaching.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     return
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the type after `=>`
 Fix: add the value: `return ...;`
